and row orbits span. The rank-one criterion gives the whole matrix algebra.
Every concrete equality is checked by the kernel. No assertion about an HS
carrier action is used. Source: ATLAS HSG1-f2r56B0, with original matrices,
hashes, candidate certificates and attribution in `../../source/README.md`.
Generated by `Small/source/generate_density.py`.
